{"pin":"BH04778","subcodes":[{"code":"BH04778","anchor":"","first_line":"Thy letter hath come before Us, and We have hearkened unto that which thou didst call upon God, both in thy public utterance and thy private communion. Verily, thy Lord [3.5s]... ...Praise be to Thee, O Lord my God! I am the one who hath sought the good pleasure of Thy will","first_line_orig":"قد حضر بین یدینا کتابک و سمعنا ما نادیت به الله فی جهرک و نجویک ان ربک... سبحانک اللّهمّ یا الهی انا الّذی اردت رضائک  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"200","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"ar","lang_name":"Arabic"},{"type":"pm","type_name":"Prayers \u0026 Meditations","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"manuscript","code":"BLIB_Or15739.276","source":"BLIB_Or15739","locator":"276"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA35:020","source":"INBA35","locator":"020","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v035/?page=13"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"INBA48:153","source":"INBA48","locator":"153","url":"https://afnanlibrary.org/d/inba_v048/?page=155"},{"kind":"manuscript","code":"NLAI_BH1.176","source":"NLAI_BH1","locator":"176","url":"http://bluefin.live/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/NLAI.BH1_.pdf#page=198"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ1.114x","source":"AQMJ1","locator":"114x","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ1/mmq1-116.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"AQMJ2.113cx","source":"AQMJ2","locator":"113cx","url":"http://reference.bahai.org/fa/t/b/MMQ2/mmq2-114.html"},{"kind":"publication","code":"BRL_DA#783","source":"BRL_DA","locator":"783","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/529891684"},{"kind":"publication","code":"PMP#121x","source":"PMP","locator":"121x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/594716881"},{"kind":"translation","code":"PM#121x","source":"PM","locator":"121x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/578706391"}]},{"code":"BH04778PBX","anchor":"pbx","translations":[{"language":"en","lang_name":"English"}],"writing_refs":[{"t